<title>USA: TABLE-Freeport-McMoRan Inc Q2 shr rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Freeport-McMoRan Inc Q2 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second Quarter	   Six Months</p>
<p>				  1997	 1996	1997	 1996</p>
<p>			    (In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p> Revenues		  $228,906  $242,793   $440,778  $499,620</p>
<p> Operating income	  37,804    46,430     73,598   116,169</p>
<p> Net income to common     7,236    12,126	8,111    32,255</p>
<p> Net EPS primary		.31	 .45	  .34	1.18</p>
<p> Avg primary shrs	  23,634    27,145     23,863    27,412</p>
<p>NOTE: Six-month 1997 EPS includes net charge $6.8 million or $0.29 a share.</p>
<p>Q2 1996 includes net gain $0.3 million or $0.01 a share.</p>
<p>Six months 1996 includes net gain $3.9 million or $0.14 a share.</p>
</text>
